# ROAD CONSTRUCTION LANDING - CURSOR RULES

## Project Overview

Create a modern, responsive, single-page landing website for a road construction equipment rental company in Kazakhstan.

No backend.
No database.
No authentication.
No CMS.

Frontend only.

Main goal:
Convert visitors into WhatsApp messages and phone calls.

---

## Tech Stack

- React
- TypeScript
- Vite
- Tailwind CSS
- Lucide React Icons

Use modern React practices.

---

## Project Structure

src/
├── assets/
│   ├── images/
│   └── icons/
├── components/
├── sections/
├── data/
├── hooks/
├── types/
├── utils/
├── App.tsx
└── main.tsx

Keep components reusable and modular.

---

## Design Requirements

Style inspiration:

- Caterpillar (CAT)
- Komatsu
- Volvo Construction Equipment

Visual style:

- Industrial
- Clean
- Modern
- Professional

Avoid:

- Corporate stock website style
- Fancy animations
- Glassmorphism
- Neumorphism
- Complex gradients

---

## Color Palette

Primary Yellow:
#F2C200

Black:
#111111

White:
#FFFFFF

Light Gray:
#F5F5F5

Success Green:
#25D366

Color distribution:

- White 40%
- Yellow 35%
- Black 25%

Website should feel bright and open.

---

## Typography

Font Family:

Montserrat

Fallback:

sans-serif

Headings:

- font-weight: 800
- uppercase
- tight spacing

Body:

- font-weight: 400-500

Avoid decorative fonts.

---

## Layout Rules

Desktop-first design.

Maximum content width:

1280px

Container:

mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8

Section spacing:

py-20 desktop
py-14 mobile

Use consistent spacing everywhere.

Avoid random margins.

---

## Landing Sections Order

1. Header
2. Hero
3. Kazakhstan Coverage Map
4. Equipment Catalog
5. Why Choose Us
6. How We Work
7. Projects Gallery
8. Contact CTA
9. Footer

Do not add extra sections.

---

## Header

Sticky header.

Contains:

- Logo
- Language switch (RU / KZ)
- WhatsApp button
- Call button

Header should remain visible during scrolling.

---

## Hero Section

Main conversion section.

Requirements:

- Large equipment image
- Bright blue sky
- Daylight scene
- Large bold heading
- Short supporting text

Buttons:

- WhatsApp
- Call

Buttons must be equal size.

Hero occupies most of first screen.

---

## Equipment Section

Cards:

- Катки
- Асфальтоукладчики
- Экскаваторы
- Грейдеры
- Самосвалы
- Погрузчики
- Тралы

Each card:

- Image
- Title
- CTA button

No prices.

No descriptions.

---

## Why Choose Us

Dark section.

Black background.

Yellow icons.

6 advantages only.

Simple grid layout.

---

## How We Work

4-step horizontal process.

1. Заявка
2. Подбор техники
3. Согласование
4. Выезд техники

Keep extremely simple.

---

## Gallery

Grid layout.

Real project photos.

No lightbox.

No sliders.

No carousels.

---

## Contact Section

Most important section after Hero.

Large heading.

WhatsApp CTA.

Call CTA.

Address.

Email.

Phone.

---

## Footer

Contains:

- Logo
- Copyright
- PDF Commercial Offer link
- Language switch

Minimal design.

---

## Images

All images stored inside:

src/assets/images

Never hardcode image URLs.

Import images properly.

Use descriptive filenames.

---

## Data Management

Do not hardcode repeated content.

Store:

- Equipment list
- Contact information
- Benefits
- Process steps

inside src/data

Render through mapping.

---

## Code Quality

Always:

- Use TypeScript types
- Create reusable components
- Avoid duplicated code
- Keep files small
- Use semantic HTML

Never:

- Use inline styles
- Hardcode repeated values
- Create giant components
- Use any type

---

## Responsiveness

Must work perfectly on:

- Mobile
- Tablet
- Desktop

Mobile experience is critical.

All sections must stack properly.

No horizontal scrolling.

---

## Performance

Optimize images.

Use lazy loading where appropriate.

Keep bundle small.

Avoid unnecessary dependencies.

---

## Animations

Minimal only.

Allowed:

- Hover effects
- Fade-in
- Small transitions

Avoid:

- Heavy motion
- Parallax
- Complex scroll animations

---

## Main Business Goal

Every design decision should increase the chance that a visitor:

1. Clicks WhatsApp
2. Calls the company

Everything else is secondary.